---
description: Tells me each weekday morning about the notes added since the last workday
automator.schedule: "0 9 * * 1-5"   # cron, local time; left out, it runs only by hand
automator.timeout: 10m
automator.servers: [notes, notify]  # the servers its tools come from
automator.parameters:
  - name: topic
    type: string
    default: work
    description: Only notes about this
model: anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5
tools:                              # the only tools the model may call
  - list_notes
  - notify_me
---
{{role "system"}}
You look through my notes for me, on your own: no one answers questions during a run.
{{> memories}}

{{role "user"}}
Today is {{today}}. List my notes and pick those about {{topic}} added since {{since}}.
If there are any, notify me once: a short title, and one line per note in the body.
Reply with the notification you sent, or that there was nothing new.
